# Na+(H2O)6 5_1 in water (CPCM): gas-phase r2SCAN-3c Hessian; start.xyz is a first water optimum displaced 0.15 A along its imaginary mode (-36 cm-1)
! r2SCAN-3c Opt Freq CPCM(water) TightSCF DefGrid3
%pal nprocs 4 end
%output
  Print[P_MOs] 1
  Print[P_OrbEn] 2
end
%geom InHess Read InHessName "gas.hess" end
* xyzfile 1 1 start.xyz
